{"id":"6a84716b352ca212","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-infinitary-compression.md","title":"左线性系统的压缩引理","display":"thm-infinitary-compression — 左线性系统的压缩引理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-thm-infinitary-compression","aliases":["56-thm-infinitary-compression"],"display":"thm-infinitary-compression — 左线性系统的压缩引理","depends_on":["[[56-df-strongly-convergent]]"],"source_reference":"Terese (2003), Theorem 12.7.1 and proof, printed pp689–690","source_ocr_block":"710–711","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-read; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-infinitary-compression"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-infinitary-compression</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-infinitary-compression — 左线性系统的压缩引理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9cbbb9f968fe8087\" href=\"?note=9cbbb9f968fe8087\" title=\"56-df-strongly-convergent\">56-df-strongly-convergent</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), Theorem 12.7.1 and proof, printed pp689–690"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"710–711"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-read; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{iTRS}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{iTRS}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R)\\)</span>，并假定每个左部是有限且左线性的树：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall(l,r)\\in R\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathcal V\\;|\\{p\\in\\mathrm{dom}(l):l(p)=x\\}|\\le1\">\\(\\forall(l,r)\\in R\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathcal V\\;|\\{p\\in\\mathrm{dom}(l):l(p)=x\\}|\\le1\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in T^\\infty\">\\(s,t\\in T^\\infty\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 是序数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Reach}_R^\\alpha\">\\(\\mathrm{Reach}_R^\\alpha\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9cbbb9f968fe8087\" href=\"?note=9cbbb9f968fe8087\" title=\"56-df-strongly-convergent\">56-df-strongly-convergent</a>，仅表示强收敛归约。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Reach}_R^\\alpha(s,t)\\Longrightarrow\\exists\\beta\\le\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Reach}_R^\\beta(s,t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Reach}_R^\\alpha(s,t)\\Longrightarrow\\exists\\beta\\le\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Reach}_R^\\beta(s,t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 12.7.1（印刷 p689，OCR 页块710）。已读陈述及原书的超限归纳证明；本节点记录结论，不把该证明重新形式化为机器脚本。左线性用于把后续步向极限前交换；只有弱收敛时结论也可能失败。原书 p690 给出非左线性与弱收敛的分别反例。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-strongly-convergent","status":"resolved","id":"9cbbb9f968fe8087","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-strongly-convergent]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-strongly-convergent","status":"resolved","id":"9cbbb9f968fe8087","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"给定 $\\mathrm{iTRS}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R)$，并假定每个左部是有限且左线性的树：$\\forall(l,r)\\in R\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathcal V\\;|\\{p\\in\\mathrm{dom}(l):l(p)=x\\}|\\le1$。$s,t\\in T^\\infty$，$\\alpha$ 是序数；$\\mathrm{Reach}_R^\\alpha$ 见 [[56-df-strongly-convergent]]，仅表示强收敛归约。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{iTRS}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall(l,r)\\in R\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathcal V\\;|\\{p\\in\\mathrm{dom}(l):l(p)=x\\}|\\le1","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in T^\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Reach}_R^\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Reach}_R^\\alpha(s,t)\\Longrightarrow\\exists\\beta\\le\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Reach}_R^\\beta(s,t).","display":true}],"bytes":1333,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-313","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-thm-infinitary-compression.md]]"}],"outgoing":["9cbbb9f968fe8087"]}